{
"file": 862,
"paths": [
"d008/d083/f020"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "06dc6941",
"en_raw": "Nobody followed you, right?"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "26a78020",
"en_raw": "...What are you saying?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "f9c61ae2",
"en_raw": "Um, I'd like to talk with"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "cd94cdec",
"en_raw": "Murase alone"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "bc25aecb",
"en_raw": "I figured you'd say that, but no"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "6dc88d4f",
"en_raw": "The kitten-in-a-jar incident"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "5099e22e",
"en_raw": "is my case"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "92402071",
"en_raw": "...Yes, your deduction is right"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "09f52ec5",
"en_raw": "It was me,"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "de2e466f",
"en_raw": "satisfied now?"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "5e5289d7",
"en_raw": "Brazening it out won't help"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "f8611577",
"en_raw": "If you don't want it blown up,"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "d84d45e7",
"en_raw": "give your reason"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "ceebeed3",
"en_raw": "You don't look like someone who"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "d0a76560",
"en_raw": "does this for no reason"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "7efae95e",
"en_raw": "You're Segawa Shinta,"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "6e202d57",
"en_raw": "right?"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "e530f281",
"en_raw": "...You mean I'm a coward?"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "4a7f40e9",
"en_raw": "Or harmless, you mean"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "c8dfb5eb",
"en_raw": "Yeah, he's Nao's best friend type"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "e877c1f1",
"en_raw": "...The Kodoku curse"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "77dc9146",
"en_raw": "I don't know much, but"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "9f190e94",
"en_raw": "apparently it can kill people"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "58017e30",
"en_raw": "With that curse, a guy named Yuasa,"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "c59b82f9",
"en_raw": "someone who ticks me off..."
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "79b3b66f",
"en_raw": "Ah, that bratty little shrimp"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "c67f8d2b",
"en_raw": "Famous~"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "d3c2f0b6",
"en_raw": "There are times he deserves to die"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "60b7ee6d",
"en_raw": "But I never had"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "52b3cdfb",
"en_raw": "that kind of knowledge"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "42b4d1c3",
"en_raw": "The one who taught me..."
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "a03461d9",
"en_raw": "...Kojiro Kume?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "6a5552ea",
"en_raw": "It's not like"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "9e77d51d",
"en_raw": "I'm the one who talked"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "933a9d99",
"en_raw": "He's a dangerous guy, right?"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "6750bc3f",
"en_raw": "You hear things even when you keep quiet"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6b1b9d56",
"en_raw": "So... please, then"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "94fa0f00",
"en_raw": "I can't take it anymore"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "86cc710d",
"en_raw": "...What a truly unreliable guy"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "01d7a84d",
"en_raw": "Shut up"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "3f54f1b7",
"en_raw": "You don't know"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "7adc2101",
"en_raw": "Kume..."
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "5697563a",
"en_raw": "Right, but I get the gist"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "afc75e60",
"en_raw": "You hate it, but can't"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "089d129c",
"en_raw": "refuse Kume's request"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "dae160ce",
"en_raw": "So today again you go out"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "dd7c5b37",
"en_raw": "to look for a kitten..."
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "2aa18f4e",
"en_raw": "Hey"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "c7f95c25",
"en_raw": "Please..."
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "7c2104f6",
"en_raw": "Hey, tell me"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "8acfd603",
"en_raw": "how did you know?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "165e7c6c",
"en_raw": "With you that flustered"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "6b3111e3",
"en_raw": "anyone could guess"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "8f170be3",
"en_raw": "Well, very good,"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "f592c884",
"en_raw": "I'm an outsider"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "b53fbee8",
"en_raw": "so for rescuing a kitten"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "17afbb66",
"en_raw": "Right"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "37570fa2",
"en_raw": "...let's settle at 5000 yen"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "c5446d97",
"en_raw": "Stop it, Sango"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "c660f568",
"en_raw": "...Fine,"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "55da45c6",
"en_raw": "I can manage that much"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "fde20234",
"en_raw": "Just kidding,"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "6af18a3e",
"en_raw": "about 2000 yen"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "60f9063e",
"en_raw": "Sango!"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "b0042be0",
"en_raw": "Just shut up already"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "768384a0",
"en_raw": "Wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "82aef05c",
"en_raw": "...Hey, Segawa,"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "439d05c6",
"en_raw": "I get the gist, but"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "eea89bbf",
"en_raw": "can I ask just one thing?"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "fbb810a6",
"en_raw": "What?"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "7aae84b2",
"en_raw": "...How many times will this go on?"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "3c153ddf",
"en_raw": "...Until the curse works,"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "dedc4ed0",
"en_raw": "I suppose"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "c0698811",
"en_raw": "But you, until then,"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "b5daf01d",
"en_raw": "jarring kittens yourself"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "e6f07c01",
"en_raw": "and paying 2000 yen yourself"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "4552b7cc",
"en_raw": "all along?"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "71b920ce",
"en_raw": "That's nastier than"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "9b432398",
"en_raw": "a futon hard-sell loan"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "1d2ec9d1",
"en_raw": "Well, whatever"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "f31f51a2",
"en_raw": "Anyway, I collect payment tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "f0540bff",
"en_raw": "at this place, okay?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "6f994f51",
"en_raw": "Hey, I'm counting on you"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "7e93a447",
"en_raw": "It's not like I like to"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "a4dcb416",
"en_raw": "lend a hand"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "5fc3e84c",
"en_raw": "Then refuse, coward!"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "97c04393",
"en_raw": "...Even so, he's my friend!"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "629e34fa",
"en_raw": "........."
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "35a0931f",
"en_raw": "...Sorry, Murase"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "5a13b3b9",
"en_raw": "I can't talk today"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "3ace62e9",
"en_raw": "I'll wait here again tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "d6c6373b",
"en_raw": "And don't call me"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "b0d54a69",
"en_raw": "it's dangerous..."
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "57b3a8ca",
"en_raw": "...I'm counting on you"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "917ef822",
"en_raw": "I'll be waiting here tomorrow"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "79dba5e2",
"en_raw": "wait up"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "dd1245ad",
"en_raw": "After making me say this much"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "e9fbc779",
"en_raw": "isn't it cruel to go home?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "85510941",
"en_raw": "If you understand that much"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "63048820",
"en_raw": "there's something I want to ask"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "c02d3c08",
"en_raw": "Please"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "0009b778",
"en_raw": "listen to me"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "4281876f",
"en_raw": "Huh..."
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "d516e8e9",
"en_raw": "Segawa...?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "57f9d44d",
"en_raw": "Plan changed:"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "30444046",
"en_raw": "wait behind the school..."
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "60abe887",
"en_raw": "Murase, come alone..."
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "2a25fdd7",
"en_raw": "so it says"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "fd1acbf5",
"en_raw": "What do you do, Nao?"
}
]
}